# IFM K2 Horizon

When editing the agent LLM or IFM-related config, use the **k2-horizon** skill (`.agents/skills/k2-horizon/SKILL.md`) and read [docs.ifm.ai](https://docs.ifm.ai/).

Hosted API: `https://api.ifm.ai/v1` — `POST /v1/chat/completions` only. Model IDs are exact strings (e.g. `IFM/K2-Horizon-375B-A23B`). Use top-level `reasoning_effort`; keep message content as plain strings for tool loops.
